What this covers
----------------
- The drawn mini characters: their designs and the drawing parameters ("looks")
  in web/src/chars/ and the `look` entries in shared/office/staff.ts.
- The floor-plan data: areas, walls, seats and furniture in shared/office/,
  and the isometric furniture and room drawings in web/src/map/.
- Icons, badges and other original graphics drawn by the web app.
- The demo screenshots in docs/screenshots/, which show only the above.

